{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.witness_8Be","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.witness_8Be","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.NormNum"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.witness_8Be","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.witness_8Be","kind":"theorem","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/PauliWitness/witness_8Be.lean#L25-L36","doc":"**Pauli witness for ${}^{8}\\mathrm{Be}$** ($Z=4$, $N=4$, $A=8$).\n\nThe Gröbner normal form in $H_8(q)$ gives $F_{\\mathrm{Pauli}}^{(8)}\n\\approx 0.368$.  The pre-reduction term count is $8!/8 = 7! = 5040$,\ncollapsing to $8$ terms after the quotient ideals.  Structural counts\nare discharged by computation; the empirical Pauli factor is the single\nconjectural input carried by `[Witness8BePauli]`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:witness-8be","label":"def:witness-8be","md":"quantum-observable-universe/appendix-nf-witnesses/witness-8be.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.Witness8BePauli.pauli_approx","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.Witness8BePauli.pauli_approx","kind":"theorem","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/PauliWitness/witness_8Be.lean#L23-L23","doc":"The `H₈(q)` Gröbner normal form yields `F_Pauli ≈ 0.368`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.Witness8BePauli.F_Pauli","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.Witness8BePauli.F_Pauli","kind":"def","line":21,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/PauliWitness/witness_8Be.lean#L21-L21","doc":"Pauli witness `F_Pauli^{(8)}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.Witness8BePauli.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.Witness8BePauli.mk","kind":"ctor","line":19,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/PauliWitness/witness_8Be.lean#L19-L19","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.Witness8BePauli","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.Witness8BePauli","kind":"class","line":16,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/PauliWitness/witness_8Be.lean#L16-L23","doc":"The one genuinely-open input for the ⁸Be witness: the empirical Pauli\nfactor `F_Pauli^{(8)} ≈ 0.368` from the `H₈(q)` Gröbner normal form\n(a categorical derivation of the value is open). ","signatureChunk":0}]}